<title>FRANCE: De Dietrich shares suspended.</title>
<headline>De Dietrich shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of French diversified equipment maker De Dietrich has been suspended for Wednesday and Thursday pending release on Thursday of a statement, the SBF French stock markets association said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The share closed on Tuesday at 260 francs.</p>
<p>The group's activities include making heating equipment, equipment for the chemical and pharmaceutical industries, railway and other mechanical equipment, the manufacture and installation of railway track and forestry related activities.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 ylg/pmc</p>
